  "cil_liability": false,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development would extend beyond a wall forming a side elevation at the front of the property of the original dwellinghouse. In accordance with limitation A.1(j)(iii) of Part 1, Class A of Schedule 2 to the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended), where an enlarged part of a dwelling house extends beyond a wall forming a side elevation of the original dwellinghouse, the enlarged part must not have a width greater than half the width of the original dwellinghouse and therefore fails to comply with limitation A.1(j)(iii). Consequently, the proposed development does not fall within the limitations of Class A permitted development and prior approval cannot be granted under this provision."
  ]
